      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَانَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A nose-ring of brass</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُرَةٌ</span> M, K, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْ صُفْرٍ</span>
